{"pageid":5112,"title":"Landhauler","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Landhauler</span>","revid":21715,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 434px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/ad/Landhauler.png/revision/latest?cb=20260528174409\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"A landhauler in an open field.\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/ad/Landhauler.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/434?cb=20260528174409\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"434\" height=\"200\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Landhauler.png\" data-image-key=\"Landhauler.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Landhauler.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">A landhauler in an open field.</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 431px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/6/66/Landhauler-Dump_Truck.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20260529172126\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Landhauler-Dump Truck\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/6/66/Landhauler-Dump_Truck.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/431?cb=20260529172126\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"431\" height=\"323\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Landhauler-Dump Truck.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Landhauler-Dump_Truck.jpg\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Landhauler-Dump_Truck.jpg\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>The <b>landhauler</b> is a vehicle that can be bought from <a href=\"/wiki/Alan%27s_AutoLogistics\" title=\"Alan&#39;s AutoLogistics\">Alan's autologistics</a> for $50,000. It has a top speed of 75 studs per second going both forward and backward on flat land. \n</p><p>It features two wheels in the front and four more in the back. It also has one drivers seat paired with a passenger's seat right next to it, with two windowed doors on each side and a big windshield on the front.\n</p><p>It also has a sort of bin on the back of it that allows for easy transportation of various materials such as wood and ores. The bin has two options for interaction of it which are lowering and raising the bin. When the bin is fully raised, it temporarily removes the back wall of the bin so the materials inside flow out, Effectively working as a dump truck.\n</p><p>The description of the landhauler ingame is as follows: \n</p><p>\"<i>This dump of a truck can carry loads of objects, like ores, and dump them! Comes with a special ability to raise and lower the bin, where the back will automatically open.</i>\"\n</p><p>Type: Structures              Cost: $50,000\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260901222918\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.007 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.013 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 1/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:5112-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260901222918 and revision id 21715. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":[],"links":[{"title":"Alan's AutoLogistics","exists":true}],"